I am Nani Thayer! I am playful and affectionate, the &quot;shy sweetheart.&quot; Give me a little time and I will blossom into a loyal and affectionate companion. I can be adopted with Stitch or into a home that already has a young welcoming cat.&nbsp; 
I am good with dogs. I have one in my foster home and we coexist peacefully.






I am 5 months old and in great health. I am sweet as the day is long. Got room in your heart for me?

I am Stitch Thayer, a super friendly boy kitty. I am playful and affectionate. I love to play, soak up attention, and am always ready for extra cuddles. I can be adopted with Nani or into a home that already has a young welcoming cat.&nbsp;I am good with dogs.&nbsp; I have one in my foster home and we coexist peacefully.





